ramify 1

// The baseline's one separately declared testing module. Its header classifies
// its ordinary src/, so the scenario, its steps, its World and its hooks all
// carry [testing, dispatch]. It has no private access to the root: the
// configured system reaches it only through the root's expose-test of
// createTestSystem to descendants, and that symbol's [testing, dispatch] tags
// are why this header must carry both. It exposes nothing.
module integration-tests tagged [testing, dispatch]
